<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk.Razor">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <Version>1.1.6</Version>
    <AssemblyName>Template_OrgName.Xncf.Template_XncfName</AssemblyName>
    <RootNamespace>Template_OrgName.Xncf.Template_XncfName</RootNamespace>
    <GenerateEmbeddedFilesManifest>true</GenerateEmbeddedFilesManifest>
    <AddRazorSupportForMvc>true</AddRazorSupportForMvc>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild Condition=" '$(Configuration)' == 'Release' ">true</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <Description>Template_Description</Description>
    <Copyright>Template_OrgName</Copyright>
    <PackageTags>Template_OrgName,NeuCharFramework,NCF,Template_OrgName.Xncf.Template_XncfName</PackageTags>
    <Authors>Template_OrgName</Authors>
    <Owners>Template_OrgName</Owners>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>Apache-2.0</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <Title>Template_MenuName</Title>
    <!--<ProjectUrl> https://github.com/NeuCharFramework/NCF</ProjectUrl>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/NeuCharFramework/NcfPackageSources</PackageProjectUrl>-->
    <PackageIcon>icon.jpg</PackageIcon>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
      v1.0.0 创世
      [2026-04-24] Update FunctionRender request templates for simplified values and SelectionList UI metadata compatibility
      [2026-07-17] v1.1.0 更新示例 XNCF 模块的功能参数与页面本地化能力
      1、接入统一资源本地化机制，支持模块功能文案按当前文化动态显示
      2、更新 FunctionRender 与请求模型文案的资源化解析
      3、同步管理页面与前端交互文案的多语言显示
      4、补充并统一多语言资源键及资源文件
      5、补齐模板侧边菜单、页面 ViewImports 与示例页面的多语言资源接入
      6、按 Application 新架构归置 AppServices 与 DTOs，同步命名空间并精简 OHS 的职责边界
      7、增加 EventBus 请求-响应回环处理器和示例事件
      8、同步模板示例的多语言资源与 Application 目录结构
      [2026-07-26] v1.1.0 补充示例模板 EventBus 请求-响应回环与多语言能力
      [2026-07-29] v1.1.1 Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.AreaBase to 0.22.0-preview3
      [2026-07-31] v1.1.2 Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.AreaBase to 0.23.0-preview4
      [2026-08-04] v1.1.3 Dependency updates from upstream projects
      1、Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.AreaBase to 0.23.1-preview5
      2、Dependency update from Senparc.Xncf.AreasBase to 0.13.3-preview5
      [2026-08-08] v1.1.4 Dependency updates from upstream projects
      1、Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.AreaBase to 0.23.2-preview6
      2、Dependency update from Senparc.Xncf.AreasBase to 0.13.4-preview6
      [2026-08-13] v1.1.5 Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.AreaBase to 0.23.3-preview7; [5955]Senparc.Xncf.AreasBase to 0.13.5-preview7
      [2026-08-15] v1.1.6 Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.AreaBase to 0.23.4-preview8; [5955]Senparc.Xncf.AreasBase to 0.13.6-preview8
</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/NeuCharFramework/NcfPackageSources</RepositoryUrl>
    <Configurations>Debug;Release;Test;TemplateRelease</Configurations>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup Condition=" '$(Configuration)' == 'Release' ">
    <OutputPath>..\..\..\BuildOutPut</OutputPath>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
	<PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.FileProviders.Embedded" Version="10.0.2" />
    <EmbeddedResource Include="wwwroot\**\*" />
    <PackageReference Include="Senparc.CO2NET.WebApi" Version="2.1.9-preview" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Senparc.Ncf.DatabasePlant" Version="0.21.1-preview1" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <!--<PackageReference Include="Senparc.Ncf.XncfBase" Version="0.22.4-preview1" />
    <PackageReference Include="Senparc.Ncf.AreaBase" Version="0.20.5-preview1" />-->
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\..\src\Basic\Senparc.Ncf.AreaBase\Senparc.Ncf.AreaBase.csproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\..\src\Extensions\System\Senparc.Xncf.AreasBase\[5955]Senparc.Xncf.AreasBase.csproj" />

    <None Include="App_Data\SenparcTraceLog\*" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\..\..\icon.jpg" Pack="true" Visible="false" PackagePath="" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <Content Remove="App_Data\Database\SenparcConfig.config" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="App_Data\Database\SenparcConfig.config" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
